# An explicit `L2:` among the other fields of the root (the book #scope; the order of the author 2026-11-18): the interpreter executes the
# content of the record where the traversal reaches it, as it executes the body of an `if:`; the names of the code before the record are
# seen and written inside it, and the code after it goes on. Before this step the record was applied as a call of the unknown name `L2`
# (the run answered 3).
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        int: after 0
)
@: shared data[0]
int: before 1
L2:
    shared\Observed\seen := before + 41
int: after 2
shared\Observed\after := after + before
